### Health (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8083/healthz

### Service manifest (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8083/

### Understand a website
POST http://localhost:8083/extract
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://acme.com"
}

### Only specific fields
POST http://localhost:8083/extract
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://acme.com",
  "fields": ["pricing", "faq"]
}

### Poll the job (paste the id from the POST response)
GET http://localhost:8083/extract/PASTE_JOB_ID
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
